1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:04,066
Il pleut ! Où est mon parapluie ?
It's raining! Where is my umbrella?

2
00:00:04,366 --> 00:00:08,398
Je ne sais pas. Il est dans ton sac ?
I don't know. Is it in your bag?

3
00:00:08,698 --> 00:00:11,146
Non, il n'est pas là !
No, it's not there!

4
00:00:11,446 --> 00:00:15,334
Regarde, un petit chien dort sous ton parapluie !
Look, a little dog is sleeping under your umbrella!

5
00:00:15,634 --> 00:00:20,002
Il est mignon ! Je ne veux pas le réveiller.
He's cute! I don't want to wake him.

6
00:00:20,302 --> 00:00:23,302
Alors, nous restons sous la pluie ?
So, we stay in the rain?

7
00:00:23,602 --> 00:00:27,490
Oui ! Un héros aime les animaux !
Yes! A hero loves animals!

8
00:00:27,790 --> 00:00:30,502
Et nous, courons à la maison !
And us, let's run home!

